{"headword":"נָקָם","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. vengeance</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:35\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.35\">Dt 32:35</a> + 14 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.25\">Lv 26:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:28\" href=\"/Judges.16.28\">Ju 16:28</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"taken by God, abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.8\">Ez 24:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:11\" href=\"/Psalms.58.11\">ψ 58:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ בְּרִית</span> <em>vengeance of the covenant</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.25\">Lv 26:25</a> (H); <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם נקם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.8\">Is 34:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.2\">61:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.4\">63:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְדֵי נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.17\">Is 59:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לִי נָקָם וְשִׁלֵּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:35\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.35\">Dt 32:35</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לקח נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.3\">Is 47:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ יבוא</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.4\">Is 35:4</a>; c. acc. adversary <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:14\" href=\"/Micah.5.14\">Mi 5:14</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> advers. <span dir=\"rtl\">חשׁיב נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:41\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.41\">Dt 32:41</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:43\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.43\">43</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Samson against Philistines, <span dir=\"rtl\">נקם נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:28\" href=\"/Judges.16.28\">Ju 16:28</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"enemies against Judah, abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.12\">Ez 25:12</